{"source":"github","project_id":"forge","target":"rstudio/forge","id":"pr/1","ref":1,"title":"Refactor a bit and add `certify()`","description":"- Prefixed all parameters with `.`.\r\n- All function gained an `.id` parameter for the developer to specify a name for the input. This defaults to the developer inputed expression for `.x` .\r\n- Added `certify()` along with helper functions e.g. `ge()`, `gte()`, `lt()`, for common comparisons. One can also provide arbitrary conditions in the form of functions.\r\n- Revised `README` to reflect changes.","published_at":"2018-12-05T10:19:15Z","updated_at":"2018-12-05T10:40:52Z","url":"https://github.com/rstudio/forge/pull/1","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"kevinykuo","merged_at":"2018-12-05T10:40:52Z","state":"MERGED"}}
